<title>GERMANY: German 1996 maize crop put at 2.9 mln T - Toepfer.</title>
<headline>German 1996 maize crop put at 2.9 mln T - Toepfer.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Germay's 1996 maize crop was seen at 2.9 million tonnes with harvesting in its last stages, trader Alfred C Toepfer's market report for November said on Friday.</p>
<p>This was up from 2.4 million in 1995 and up 100,000 tonnes from previous estimates for 1996.</p>
<p>Yields may hit a record 7.9 tonnes per hectare compared with 7.5 tph last year and the long-term average of 7.3 tph, Toepfer said.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
